<title>UK: Ex-dividends take 7.1 points off UK's FTSE index.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends take 7.1 points off UK's FTSE index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>FTSE International Ltd said the following FTSE 100 stocks will go ex-dividend on Monday and the effect will be to take 7.112 points off the index today.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>* Barclays				     20.00   25.00    2.255</p>
<p>* Carlton Communications		    6.72    8.40    0.285</p>
<p>* Lloyds TSB Group			    9.00   11.25    3.525</p>
<p>* SmithKline Beecham			  5.20   6.50     1.046</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
